# {{POC_NAME}}

POC scaffolded from a meeting via `didio poc-from-minutes`.

## Run

```bash
npm install
npm run dev
```

## Generated files

- `src/mocks/*.ts` — mock data extracted from the meeting minutes.
- `src/pages/*.tsx` — page stubs, one per screen in the manifest.
- `src/App.tsx` — router with one Route per screen.
- `_pipeline/manifest.json` — the manifest produced by meeting-parser.
- `_pipeline/log.jsonl` — pipeline step log.

To regenerate: re-run `didio poc-from-minutes <ata>` against a fresh
directory.
